            <div xml:id="m-1e4f5ef2-4201-47d4-a030-124281b04b72">
              <lg xml:id="m-afd7e7be-0207-40f4-bf1e-d3c7ba962cbb">
                <l xml:id="m-63a596d5-e382-4aff-80a3-f8ca8e3394ab" facs="#m-94c0653a-153f-41bd-9575-e468887992a3" label="text-like">4th Sunday after Easter.</l><l xml:id="m-dd9fbad3-f721-4888-808a-683f04a71670" facs="#m-e3c762c1-de55-4ece-ab9a-4a13fdfa37e0" label="ambiguous">826</l><l xml:id="m-c1a10284-dd04-4f09-9be9-c2934bc24525" facs="#m-c388133b-d2a3-490f-80b9-30dce50a4780" label="text-like">Fourth Sunday after Easter.</l><l xml:id="m-df83a7c1-261d-476e-8f9a-a9083f44b7c5" facs="#m-7ea19387-43d7-4917-82c5-6886045b0224" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-78d1fcce-1949-4fa8-86c7-d8609ea5859b" facs="#m-06ec39c3-8968-4482-9d1c-15f13b64a33b" label="text-like">Chapter of Vespers. Carissimi : Omne datum. p. 829.</l><l xml:id="m-dcb32b4a-dcd8-4cb2-b52f-9ec23fb2b719" facs="#m-fa316a29-93c0-4a49-9616-17e08c103404" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Surréxit Dóminus. p. 239.</l><l xml:id="m-378358c7-fe8f-44d1-a4c6-a8c2c40b369e" facs="#m-5050eba9-04c9-4e18-a456-3dad23461007" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-74b579ba-bea1-412d-90e1-ffe9d1239837" facs="#m-182fcc66-de29-45fa-99ec-b32fd6fbb192" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-87613ba4-2a7a-462d-8598-dd8ce3e6585f" facs="#m-7e542d05-9e10-4c99-96e0-c78e8d1b2fe9" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-cdf65aca-f8cf-4008-8d7d-5c0652723d9d" facs="#m-0ed1a4fd-a973-4fe8-8762-9a62fec4f212" label="lyrics-like">Antáte Dómi-no * cánti-cum nó-vum, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-78114471-5a4b-4fde-8b35-72b5f8e8baaf" facs="#m-954cf522-faad-439b-89b7-9b3a36212433" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia: qui-a mi-ra-bí- li-a fé-cit Dómi-nus, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-c418666d-c300-43a5-899c-a7bb821bfc87" facs="#m-90b04bdf-833c-4932-8bc9-904dbbd61df0" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia: ante conspéctum gén-ti-um reve lá¬</l><l xml:id="m-6c723215-6214-42e4-9bd2-58ac4957e555" facs="#m-3942d466-61ca-4436-856a-9fd166f4a817" label="lyrics-like">vit justí-ti-am sú- am, alle-lú- ia, alle- lú- ia. Ps. Sal¬</l><l xml:id="m-9ac9d8c4-79fa-42fb-a523-a1b5498703a7" facs="#m-046769d9-0126-47df-87c4-247008a816c1" label="lyrics-like">vá-vit sí-bi déxte-ra é-jus: “et bráchi-um sánctum é-jus.</l><l xml:id="m-a0ed0f6f-f993-4791-9d78-66a17b18f68a" facs="#m-7138a1a6-ae4d-4f81-98ac-96c52adaf155" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri- a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-9cbb8c3d-27d9-4aa8-a1d0-331f1f9e5ba4" facs="#m-f9ea9608-82d2-47bc-a6e3-25c3f4f85410" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-c62eadcc-e9cc-4974-99e9-a0760ba52bb9" facs="#m-2295c1d2-36e8-4678-b8db-aef951d1f1ca" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui fidélium mentes únius mundánas varietátes, ibi nostra fixa</l><l xml:id="m-43c9cfee-3b3c-41a1-9607-436838a85554" facs="#m-c522fc70-4429-41ec-b06e-563e6e06f90d" label="lyrics-like">I éfficis voluntátis: t da pópu¬</l><l xml:id="m-a05bdceb-b5ca-41e6-9376-c580ce659301" facs="#m-e865d121-81ee-49ff-b16c-0071a3b46e7d" label="lyrics-like">sint corda, ubi vera sunt gáudia.</l><l xml:id="m-cd875725-f1dc-4081-95a9-e109811b2998" facs="#m-4eae4686-1245-44ff-9863-248849a1f573" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-f00b13dd-a733-4c01-a303-181143a6431c" facs="#m-2fcef760-70ad-4985-95ae-bb1d35784f36" label="lyrics-like">lis tuis id amáre quod praécipis, id</l><l xml:id="m-5be34aa0-14cf-41a8-8a45-3159876b0126" facs="#m-d7365c47-16e6-4b86-9863-5cbba5393e41" label="lyrics-like">desideráre quod promittis;“ut inter</l><l xml:id="m-30f1da64-2320-4d63-ba45-c743783bb4b6" facs="#m-0ad25989-6a55-4d1b-a80a-48be8768e302" label="text-like">2. Of Our Lady, p. 817. — 3. For the Church or for the Pope, p. 819.</l><l xml:id="m-323010b2-b5cf-4e17-84ee-d7ac0fc41e4e" facs="#m-49f21f06-a7eb-46bf-845a-b360a46532c8" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Jacobi Apostoli. Jac. I. c.</l><l xml:id="m-4ffb7444-d9d7-47d4-a9f4-2e3bf86198d1" facs="#m-232bd5ee-618a-44d0-9f00-166c028cd57c" label="lyrics-like">vArissimi: Omne datum ópti-!Patre lúminum, apud quem nor</l><l xml:id="m-2d6e664a-8f04-44d6-a93f-94ae10926f65" facs="#m-8a8c3ebc-76ad-4283-bd0b-bebe1d138d7e" label="lyrics-like">est transmutátió, nec vicissitúdini</l><l xml:id="m-ad0269b4-a2df-4c34-9efb-44965e04267a" facs="#m-296feda0-8691-46f0-8897-238b8b36e674" label="lyrics-like">Lmum, et omne donum perfé¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c60bf85-bc8b-4079-a5b4-05aff1c7f5ea" facs="#m-394f7a37-0c16-4cf7-b70d-5329e6c96ce4" label="lyrics-like">ctum desúrsum est, descéndens al obumbrátio. Voluntárie enim gé</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
